{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176460/extras/63a25540889cc0066c3c873ea875865d.avif?t=1585168950\" width=379 height=207 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176460/extras/c42750688ff3b17ef69da27ba7813562.avif?t=1585168950\" width=572 height=66 /></span><br><br><strong><i>They Came From a Communist Planet</i></strong> is a first-person adventure game about depression and revolution. Stuck in a cycle of debt and isolation, your world suddenly changes when aliens reach earth carrying a message of socialist insurrection. Fight your way past water cannons, tear gas, and riot police, as aliens help guide you to a future beyond capitalism!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A short, sweet adventure game, lasting roughly 30-45 minutes.<br></li><li>Throw trash, bricks, and Molotov cocktails as you riot in a destructible late-capitalist neighborhood.<br></li><li>Receive messages from UFOs above as you experience a chilling tale of senseless greed, engineered depression, and the aliens who might offer hope.<br></li><li>Use protesting abilities to explore and unlock new parts of the city in this Metroidvania-Lite.<br></li><li>Search alleys to find hidden spray paint canisters and see what secrets they might unlock.</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1176460?t=1585168950","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1176460?t=1585168950","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176460/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1585168950","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1176460/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1585168950","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id